{"4669620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Defense Of Legends", "steam_appid": 4669620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defense Of Legends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense Of Legends is a strategy-focused game that combines classic tower defense gameplay with character upgrades and an item-based build system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As enemies emerge from portals and try to reach their target, you place your characters in the right positions, upgrade them, and buy suitable items for each character to create different builds. More attack power, stronger defense, faster attacks, or magic damage? Every choice changes your characters’ roles on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply placing characters is not enough. You decide which characters to upgrade, which items to buy, and what kind of build to create against enemy waves. Build your strategy, strengthen your characters, and stop the enemies from reaching the green portal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warrior</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669620/extras/5bd6c55b059ef1df2c040954a93bc644.poster.avif?t=1786219495\" width=134 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669620/extras/5bd6c55b059ef1df2c040954a93bc644.webm?t=1786219495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669620/extras/5bd6c55b059ef1df2c040954a93bc644.mp4?t=1786219495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669620/extras/695b5b3c1ba41f02b77faf4d223e5d3e.poster.avif?t=1786219495\" width=134 height=134 ><source src=\"https://sh